@baseUrl = https://127.0.0.1:8445/api/extensions/hl7v2-validation
@set = ihe-pam-fr-2.11.2

### 0. Get active settings (profiles directory)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 0b. Update profiles directory and reload
POST {{baseUrl}}/settings
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profilesDir": "/hl7v2-profiles"
}

### 1. List loaded profile sets
GET {{baseUrl}}/sets
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 2. Reload profile sets from disk
POST {{baseUrl}}/sets/reload
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 3. Validate ADT^A01 with NIST -> returns HL7v2 ACK (ER7)
POST {{baseUrl}}/validate?set={{set}}&engine=nist
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/hl7-v2+er7
Accept: application/hl7-v2+er7

< ./ihe-pam-fr-2.11.2/adt-a01-admission-pam-fr.er7

### 4. Validate ADT^A01 with HAPI -> returns JSON report
POST {{baseUrl}}/validate?set={{set}}&engine=hapi
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/hl7-v2+er7
Accept: application/json

< ./ihe-pam-fr-2.11.2/adt-a01-admission-pam-fr.er7

### 5. Validate ADT^A01 with NIST -> returns plain text report
POST {{baseUrl}}/validate?set={{set}}&engine=nist
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/hl7-v2+er7
Accept: text/plain

< ./ihe-pam-fr-2.11.2/adt-a01-admission-pam-fr.er7

### 6. Validate invalid ADT^A08 (missing/wrong structure) with NIST -> JSON report
POST {{baseUrl}}/validate?set={{set}}&engine=nist
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/hl7-v2+er7
Accept: application/json

< ./ihe-pam-fr-2.11.2/adt-a08-structure-adt-a01.er7
